Alpha binaries for these, so I'm out of luck.  New RPMS pre-bundled
software is very slim for the Alphas, and I believe there is lots of
source that isn't friendly to 64-bit Alphas.  Also, your memory won't
go as far since the Alpha chews more of it up to arrive at 64-bits.

Other than that, I'm thrilled to have a "baby" Alpha.  While I can
also dual boot to pristine Linux on my dual P6/200/512k machine, I'm
enjoying playing with the little Alpha.  I'm practicing for the day
