The PC164 is very limited. First off, you have to fill all 8 banks for
maximum memory bandwidth. Second off, you have to have similarly-sized
simms in the thing. And no, it doesn't handle SDRAM. The PC164LX is
the modern equivalent, and it takes SDRAM and doesn't require you to
fill all the banks or anything.

