Your code loads *a1...*a6 and *nx repeatedly even though they
(presumably) don't change.  All these loads waste time and serialize
things that could otherwise be scheduled to make use of pipelining.
Use the forc^H^H^H^Hregisters, Luke!

Try something like the code below and let us know what happens.

