Intel PD440FX     PentiumII  66/266  512+16/16   10.8     6.89  May97 www.intel

So for what SPECint/fp benchmarks measures, the 233MHz DEC machines are
inferior to P5MMX 233MHz, PPro 200MHz, Pentium II 233/266MHz.

