> 09/09/96 12:00AM      1,245,187 Xtga-ELF-EV4-test.gz
> 09/10/96 12:00AM      1,246,876 Xtga-ELF-EV5-test.gz
> 04/21/96 12:00AM         11,982 axpbin-Xtga-BETA-0.0.README

Here's what I did;

  gunzip Xtgz-ELF-EV5-test.gz

  cp Xtga-ELF-EV5-test /usr/X11R6/bin/XF86_TGA
 
  chmod 4711 XF86_TGA (from the appropriate directory of course)

  ln -sf /usr/X11R6/bin/XF86_TGA /etc/X11/X

  ln -sf /usr/X11R6/bin/XF86_TGA /usr/X11R6/bin/X

Now vi axpbin-Xtga-BETA-0.0.README and do what it says about the
membase, set your monitor horizontal and vertical sync, uncomment the
proper modeline, etc. Be sure to remove the message at the beginning of
the file or strange things happen. Then;

  cp axpbin-Xtga-BETA-0.0.README /etc/X11/XF86Config

  ln -sf /etc/X11/XF86Config /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/XF86Config

  startx

Please take a close look at the docs and don't flame me. I'm not
perfect.

Good Luck,
Charles



