Amit Chatterjee (asav@ix.netcom.com) wrote:
: I am trying to setup an Alpha station 400 (Avanti) to accept remote jobs
: from other UNIX and Linux systems connected by TCP/IP LAN. I have setup
: the other systems to do remote UNIX printing and have setup the alpha
