Been there, done that. Got help :-)

: What am I doing wrong ? Is there a fix for this ?

Well, you're doing nothing wrong, it's just that the version of lpd that
you are running is broken. To fix things, I got the latest sources
(in my case from the RedHat 4.2 CDs) and then recompiled them. The real
secret is that you must add the definition -Dgetline=get_line in the
makefile. Then make the sources, do a make install and reboot. After that
all should work fine (does for me anyway).

